<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>PRAYAANA 2K26 | Staff Portal</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      color: #f7f3ff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #35205e 0%, transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #080812, #111025 60%, #090911);
    }

    .panel {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 480px;
      padding: 40px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(24, 21, 43, 0.88);
      border: 1px solid #554078;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 70px #0008;
    }

    .logo {
      color: #c7a5ff;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 20px 0 8px;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 7vw, 40px);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    p {
      color: #c6bfd8;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      color: #e1d0ff;
      background: #34234c;
      border: 1px solid #654b88;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #938aa9;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="panel">
    <div class="logo">PRAYAANA 2K26</div>
    <h1>STAFF PORTAL</h1>
    <p>
      The official event management portal is being prepared
      for authorized organizers.
    </p>
    <div class="status">Setup in progress</div>
    <p class="note">
      Staff access is not enabled yet.<br>
      Please wait for instructions from the event administration team.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
